From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anas <assosbs9@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:19:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ExeFS mods: the modules a mod added are loaded though main's
 build row omits them

Upstream now loads the modules of the profile's build row for main's build ID (Mario Kart World's versions differ in modules). The row of a derived profile is made from the ExeFS before the mods, so Tears of the Kingdom Online's subsdk4 was rewritten and packed but never loaded ("modules of main's build 9b4e43650501a4d4: main subsdk0 sdk (the profile lists 4)"): no online. A profile module missing from the row whose rewrite is in the folder is loaded too, in the profile's order.

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: TOTK Online and SMO Online inactive after the move to nxnative eed7c42
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#214

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 dm/host/main.c | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/dm/host/main.c b/dm/host/main.c
index 6617759..0bf95bb 100644
--- a/dm/host/main.c
+++ b/dm/host/main.c
@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@
 #include <CoreFoundation/CoreFoundation.h>
 #include <stdatomic.h>
 #include <sys/resource.h>
+#include <sys/stat.h>
 #include <sys/sysctl.h>
 #include <sys/time.h>
 #include <unistd.h>
@@ -85,6 +86,10 @@ static int profile_modules(const char *dir, const char **names) {
             const char *s = strstr(rows[r].mods, all[k]); size_t l = strlen(all[k]);
             while (s && !((s == rows[r].mods || s[-1] == ' ') && (!s[l] || s[l] == ' '))) s = strstr(s + 1, all[k]);
             if (s) names[n++] = all[k];
+            else {   // NX2Apple: not in the build's row but rewritten here: a module an ExeFS mod added (Tears of the Kingdom Online's subsdk4, Super Mario Odyssey: Online's subsdk1)
+                char mp[1024]; struct stat mst; snprintf(mp, sizeof mp, "%s/%s.patched.bin", dir, all[k]);
+                if (!stat(mp, &mst)) { names[n++] = all[k]; LOG("module %s: not in main's build row, loaded since an ExeFS mod added it (%s)", all[k], mp); }
+            }
         }
         if (n < DM_GAME_NMOD) LOG("modules of main's build %.16s: %s (the profile lists %d)", bid, rows[r].mods, DM_GAME_NMOD);
         return n;
